      "value": "@{6026b24dad4389164dbfa27e|full_name}: it's not really for udon stuff. It's a universal \"vrchat time zone\" and \"current time+date\" that functions as a reference for event start points that avoids the need for conversion.\nWouldn't hurt to show the player's local time either, but if there's an accessible reference that avoids the use of \"day of week, day of month\" it helps a lot, in every other service I've used that has it.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
