      "value": "@{5f318f198b38ac71ff34f726|full_name}: soooo you're basically suggesting they implement utc into the game... (utc is the standard without dst, gmt is the one with dst)\nAaand that's already kinda used by vrc, but you'll still have to convert back and forth between your own time. Even if the game displayed 12:50 UTC and the event is at 15:00 UTC I'll still need to keep in mind that thats 00:00 KST...\nAdd to that that even people don't agree what time standard to use and you have a recipe for confusion...\nThat said I'm all for showing your own time in the vrc menu together with utc 0. to me it just seems like something a large chunk of the community won't follow....",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
