      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{6026b24dad4389164dbfa27e|full_name}: I know a ton of people would, if it was something you could easily find both on the website, on your system clock, and in game. Right now there's still the issue of \"day of week\" confusing people. it is currently 2am jst saturday, and 1pm edt friday. it's 5pm utc \"today\" for me but 5pm utc \"yesterday\" for japan. \nit is, however, Day 113 17:00 everywhere on earth.  I hope i'm being clear.",
